cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself (metadata
  below) and the accompanying paper (see `preferred-citation`).
title: "PICO: Fast Voxelwise SNR Estimation for Iterative MRI Reconstructions"
abstract: >-
  PICO (Probing Image-space COvariance) is a stochastic diagonal estimator for
  voxelwise noise-variance maps in linear and nonlinear iterative MRI
  reconstructions, from which SNR and g-factor maps are derived. This repository
  is the companion toolbox for the Dalmaz et al. manuscript "Fast Voxelwise SNR
  Estimation for Iterative MRI Reconstructions," under revision for Magnetic
  Resonance in Medicine.
type: software
# `version` and `date-released` are intentionally omitted until the
# manuscript-associated GitHub release is published.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/onat-dalmaz/pico_noise_estimation_toolbox"
url: "https://github.com/onat-dalmaz/pico_noise_estimation_toolbox"
keywords:
  - noise estimation
  - SNR
  - g-factor
  - non-Cartesian MRI
  - iterative reconstruction
  - compressed sensing
